{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Special Items & Powers tab of the in-game menu displays the special items, ",["l","书","book"]," powers, and mastery powers ",["l","玩家角色","the Player"]," has collected."]]]],["Special Items",2,[["p",["Special items typically involve a quest line which rewards the Player with an item yielding special power or access."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Use"]},{"h":1,"v":["Obtained"]}],[[["l","森林魔法","Forest Magic"]],["Unlocks the ability to read the language of the Junimos."],["Reward from the ",["l","任务","\"Meet The Wizard\" Quest"],", unlocked the morning after the player examines the first golden scroll in the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],"."]],[[["l","矮人语教程","Dwarvish Translation Guide"]],["Unlocks the ability to speak to the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and the dwarf in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],"."],["Reward from the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"]," after donating all 4 ",["l","古物","dwarf scrolls"],"."]],[[["l","生锈的钥匙","Rusty Key"]],["Used to enter ",["l","下水道","the Sewers"],"."],["Received from ",["l","冈瑟","Gunther"]," the day after donating 60 items to the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],"."]],[[["l","会员卡","Club Card"]],["Used to enter the ",["l","赌场","Casino"],"."],["Completing the ",["l","任务","\"The Mysterious Qi\" Quest"],"."]],[[["l","特殊的魅力","Special Charm"]],["Permanently increases daily ",["l","运气","luck"],"."],["From the driver in the truck outside ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"]," (or the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"]," if ",["l","收集包","The Missing Bundle"]," is completed) after finding ",["l","秘密纸条","Secret Note #20"]," and giving him a ",["l","兔子的脚","Rabbit's Foot"],"."]],[[["l","头骨钥匙","Skull Key"]],["Unlocks the door to the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," and unlocks the ",["l","祝尼魔赛车","Junimo Kart"]," machine in ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"],"."],["From the chest on floor 120 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."]],[[["l","放大镜","Magnifying Glass"]],["Unlocks the ability to find ",["l","秘密纸条","Secret Notes"],"."],["After completing the ",["l","任务","\"A Winter Mystery\" Quest"],"."]],[[["l","黑暗护身符","Dark Talisman"]],[["l","任务","Quest"]," item"],["From the chest in the ",["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"],"."]],[[["l","魔法墨水","Magic Ink"]],[["l","任务","Quest"]," item"],["Found on a table in the ",["l","女巫小屋","Witch's Hut"],"."]],[[["l","熊的知识","Bear's Knowledge"]],["Increases sell price of ",["l","黑莓","Blackberries"]," and ",["l","美洲大树莓","Salmonberries"]," by 3x."],["Bringing ",["l","枫糖浆","Maple Syrup"]," into the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"]," after finding ",["l","秘密纸条","Secret Note #23"],"."]],[[["l","青葱技术","Spring Onion Mastery"]],["Increases sell price of ",["l","大葱","Spring Onion"],"s by 5x."],["After triggering ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]," and ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],"' 8 heart event."]],[[["l","小镇钥匙","Key To The Town"]],["Allows access to all buildings in town, at any time of day (with some restrictions)."],["Bought from ",["l","齐先生的核桃房","Qi's Walnut Room"]," for 20 Qi Gems ",["l","齐钻","Qi Gem"],"s."]]]]]],["Book Powers",2,[["p",["Each of these powers is obtained after reading a specific book for the first time. The books are obtained in a variety of ways."]],["p",["The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," who visits the town twice every month sells many of them, but most of them are only available starting in Year 3 and only have a ≈9% chance to appear."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Location"]}],[[["l","价格目录","Price Catalogue"]],["You can now see the value of your items."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 3,000g"]]]]]}],[[["l","洞穴地图绘制法","Mapping Cave Systems"]],["You get a 50% discount on Marlon's item retrieval service."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Found in a box in the back of the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],". Must slay at least 1000 ",["l","怪物","monsters"]," total to open door."]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","风之道 第一部分","Way Of The Wind pt. 1"]],["You run a little bit faster."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 15,000g"]]]]]}],[[["l","风之道 第二部分","Way Of The Wind pt. 2"]],["You run a little bit faster."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 35,000g after having obtained the power from ",["l","风之道 第一部分","Way Of The Wind pt. 1"]]]]]]}],[[["l","怪物图鉴","Monster Compendium"]],["Monsters have a small chance to drop double loot."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Dropped from slain ",["l","怪物","monsters"]]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","交友导论","Friendship 101"]],["You become friends with people a little faster."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Given as a prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园","prize machine"]," in Lewis' house"]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","铜墙铁壁","Jack Be Nimble, Jack Be Thick"]],["Gain +1 Defense."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Obtained from ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s"]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","伐木秘事","Woody's Secret"]],["Felled trees have a 5% chance to yield double the wood."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Obtained from chopping ",["l","树","trees"]]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","浣熊日记","Raccoon Journal"]],["Weeds have a greater chance to yield mixed seeds."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Given as a reward for completing the second raccoon item quest."]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]],[1,["Traded from the ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Raccoon Wife's Shop"]," for 999 ",["l","纤维","Fiber"]]]]]]}],[[["l","海之宝石","Jewels Of The Sea"]],["Fishing treasure chests have a chance to yield roe."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Obtained as a reward from a ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chest"]]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","矮人安全手册","Dwarvish Safety Manual"]],["Bombs deal 25% less damage to you."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," for 4,000g"]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","捕蟹秘籍","The Art O' Crabbing"]],["Crab pots have a 25% chance to yield double."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Obtained as an Iridium Tier reward on either day of the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," if the player hasn't received it from the festival before"]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","小巷自助餐","The Alleyway Buffet"]],["You have a greater chance to find items in the trash."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Found in the gold trash can between the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," and the ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],", through a hidden hole in the fence."]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","钻石猎人","The Diamond Hunter"]],["All stones have a chance to drop a diamond when mined by hand."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the Dwarf in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," for 10 ",["i","(O)72","Diamond"],"."]]]]]}],[[["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"]],["You have a slightly greater chance to find Mystery Boxes."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Found in ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es or ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es"]]]]]}],[[["l","马术秘籍","Horse: The Book"]],["You gain a little extra speed when riding a horse."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 25,000g"]]]]]}],[[["l","古代珍宝鉴定指南","Treasure Appraisal Guide"]],["You will fetch a better price when selling artifacts."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Found in ",["l","古物宝藏","Artifact Trove"],"s"]],[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 20,000g starting in year 3"]]]]]}],[[["l","草中窜","Ol' Slitherlegs"]],["You will now run a lot faster through grass and crops."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," for 25,000g"]]]]]}],[[["l","动物目录","Animal Catalogue"]],["You can access Marnie's shop when she's not around."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Bought from ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"]," for 5,000g starting in year 2"]]]]]}]]]]],["Mastery Powers",2,[["p",["Five additional powers can be obtained by visiting the ",["l","精通山洞","Mastery Cave"]," after reaching level 10 in all five ",["l","技能","skills"],". Each ",["l","精通山洞","mastery"]," requires an additional level for which increasingly more experience is required."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]}],[[["l","精通山洞","Farming Mastery"]],["You can now find ",["l","金色动物饼干","Golden Animal Cracker"],"s, which permanently doubles a farm animal's produce. Doesn't work on ",["l","猪","pig"],"s."]],[[["l","精通山洞","Mining Mastery"]],[["l","采矿","Gem-bearing rocks"]," now grant twice the gems."]],[[["l","精通山洞","Foraging Mastery"]],["You can now find ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es, which contain superior items."]],[[["l","精通山洞","Fishing Mastery"]],["You can now encounter ",["l","钓鱼","Golden Fishing Treasure Chests"],"."]],[[["l","精通山洞","Combat Mastery"]],["Unlocks a new equipment slot for ",["l","饰品","trinkets"],". Trinkets can be found while adventuring and grant special powers."]]]]]]]}